  m_text: "<b>ARCHAEOLOGICAL DISCOVERY & CONTEXT:</b>\nCentral to the Jbel Ighoud
    Levallois knapping industry (~300,000 BP).\n\n<b>LITHIC CHARACTERISTICS:</b>\nRock
    1 - Silex (Flint): Extreme hardness with razor conchoidal cleavage. Produces
    sharp flakes and spear points.\n\n<color=#64748B><size=12>\u2022 Weight Impact:
    Occupies 0.7% of your 200 kg expedition capacity.\n\u2022 Drop back into the
    cave environment at any time to recover encumbrance allowance.</size></color>"
